They reflected on the sunset, the time when the sun goes down and night begins. During the sunset, they feel nature becomes fresh, bright, and charming, and the sun seems like a disc of gold. At sunset one can enjoy its serenity, while nature seems to be in a hurry: people finish their work and return home, birds return to their nests, and the cowherds busy themselves bringing the cattle home. As the sun sets, nature looks very beautiful before slowly darkening, and the slight darkness of the sunset creates a feeling of joy and tranquility. They noted that the beauty of the sunset helps a poet generate ideas and compose poems.